# Prettier's reach in this repo is the explicit glob list in package.json's
# `format` script, not a directory walk. This file narrows that reach where the
# decision needs to be recorded rather than inferred.

# scripts/windows-llrt-probe.mjs — the Phase 3 Windows/LLRT primitive probe.
#
# scripts/*.mjs is inside `pnpm format`'s glob so the directory is covered going
# forward; this one file is deliberately exempt from it.
#
# The probe is a temporary CI diagnostic with a scheduled delete date: it and its
# workflow are removed in Phase 9 when CI-01 lands the permanent windows-latest
# regression job (D-02). Its entire product is an archived artifact of measured
# conclusions, which makes it worth keeping diffable against the exact blob that
# produced the banked run.
#
# Prettier's reflow here is semantics-preserving — measured: it only expands call
# arguments and object literals vertically and never alters a template literal's
# contents, so the probe's single-emission output grammar is untouched. But it
# rewrites 21 hunks (+240/-59 lines, 599 -> 780) of a 599-line file. Burying a
# handful of reviewed fixes under a mechanical rewrite of the whole file costs
# more than the formatting gains on a file that is deleted in a few phases.
#
# Recorded here rather than left as an accident of the glob (code review WR-07).
# Delete this entry together with the probe in Phase 9.
